The text of "The House Bdoyan" (in Armenian, English and Russian), the
books and research handbooks in the files/ folder, the family charts, and
the maps and charts in the img/ folder that were made for this project are
provided for personal and family use.

You may read, download, print and share them with family members and for
private genealogical research, provided they are not changed and this
notice is kept. Any other use, including republishing the text elsewhere or
using it commercially, requires written permission from the author.

Information contributed by family members remains theirs; it is published
here with their consent and may be withdrawn on request.

The website code (index.html, apart from its text content) may be reused
freely.

